WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.046
How can a disorder as common 
as autism go so undiagnosed

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:07.465
and so unnoticed within women?

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:14.640
Well, a part of the answer is 
that many girls who have autism

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.600
observe the way others
around them behave,

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.228
realize that they are different,

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:22.772
then change the way they 
act in order to fit in.

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.900
After I was diagnosed,

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.594
I felt as though I truly 
understood myself.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:32.323
It gave me relief, clarity,

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:35.969
and the ability to learn more 
about myself and my brain.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:40.331
There is beauty in the spectrum.

00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:42.459
I encourage those of you with autism

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:45.000
to unmask and be your genuine self.

00:00:45.336 --> 00:00:49.090
Whether you are neurotypical
or neurodivergent,

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:53.970
I urge all of you to remember that 
there is value in our differences,

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:58.308
and acknowledging them allows 
for more authentic relationships.

